    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'NOWV' is a project for celebrating NingNing(a member of the South Korean idol group aespa)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a character who has disability of an eye and face challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It might be tough to get through, but you will finally find it possible to overcome the challenges by transforming the disability into the power of inner sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project has a set progression and ending; the player will experience the following message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Disability even could be the power to find the answer.'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'We can overcome whatever we think it as a defect by changing our mind.'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[About Game Play]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a puzzle game, you will face a quest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the 'Real Key', and put it on the altar. You have only three chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail, you will get into the deeper mind, where you can get a hint to find the key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, if you succeed, you can get the message of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'NOWV' is a project for celebrating NingNing(a member of the South Korean idol group aespa)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a character who has disability of an eye and face challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It might be tough to get through, but you will finally find it possible to overcome the challenges by transforming the disability into the power of inner sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project has a set progression and ending; the player will experience the following message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Disability even could be the power to find the answer.'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'We can overcome whatever we think it as a defect by changing our mind.'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[About Game Play]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a puzzle game, you will face a quest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the 'Real Key', and put it on the altar. You have only three chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail, you will get into the deeper mind, where you can get a hint to find the key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, if you succeed, you can get the message of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "This game is inspired by Ningning, a member of the South Korean idol group aespa. It conveys the message that even one's flaws can become strengths through inner growth.",
